## moult_hp-01 (Homepage (hp-01)) - 2026-10-17

Concept build, not a client. Review page: `outputs/templates/moult_hp-01_2026-10-17/index.html`. All copy humanizer-passed, no em dashes, X captions under 280 chars.

**TS-MOULT-HP01-COVER-VID - `moult_hp-01 cover.mp4`** [linkedin, instagram]
```
Built a homepage for MOULT, a pet grooming brand I made up. It's a concept build, not a client.

The store sells one thing: a slicker brush that drops the fur in a single clump when you press a button. So the homepage has one job, getting a dog owner who is tired of lint rollers to that button.

How I laid it out:
✅ the headline sells the clean sofa before it mentions the brush
✅ the story section names the annoying part, cleaning the brush itself
✅ the product card comes third, with the price and one button
✅ dogs, cats and the clean-up each get a card, then reviews

Desktop and mobile run in the same order. I didn't drop a section for the small screen.

Need a store like this built? Start here: koolestpro.com/services/page-build

#shopify #ecommerce #webdesign #homepage
```

