```
The whole MOULT homepage, split into two columns.

Left column makes the case: the sofa promise, the story about brushes that won't let go of fur, then the product and price.

Right column answers "will it work on my pet". Dogs, cats, the clean-up, reviews, the three promises, the newsletter.

I wanted the page to answer questions in the order a doubtful pet owner would ask them. Concept build for a brand I made up.

